# Repo-root .ignore: ripgrep (which Hermes's search_files uses) reads this file and ranks it
# above .gitignore. Re-include gitignored generated code so the agent can SEARCH it, not just
# read it by path. Both negations are required: a negated pattern cannot re-include a file
# whose parent directory is excluded.
!**/Generated/
!**/Generated/**
# add other generated roots here, e.g.
# !**/obj/*.g.cs
